{"id":"3170ce92c093aa58","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-biconditional.md","title":"逐句、数字统一与闭项统一真理双条件","display":"df-truth-biconditional — 逐句、数字统一与闭项统一真理双条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-biconditional","aliases":["91-df-truth-biconditional","91-df-T-biconditional","91-df-disquotation-biconditional"],"display":"df-truth-biconditional — 逐句、数字统一与闭项统一真理双条件","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-biconditional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-biconditional</span><span>91-df-T-biconditional</span><span>91-df-disquotation-biconditional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-biconditional — 逐句、数字统一与闭项统一真理双条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTm}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTm}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a> 的闭项编码域；向量量词逐分量限制在该域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为基础句子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\vec x)\">\\(\\theta(\\vec x)\\)</span> 为固定基础公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> 是数字代入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> 是闭项代入编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TBicond},\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{num}},\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{tm}}\">\\(\\operatorname{TBicond},\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{num}},\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{tm}}\\)</span> 是下述对象公式；不带上标的 UTBicond 采用原书闭项版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TBicond}_T(\\varphi)\\coloneqq T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TBicond}_T(\\varphi)\\coloneqq T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{num}}_T(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec x\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\vec x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{num}}_T(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec x\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\vec x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_T(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_T(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个矩阵产生一个对象公式，全部矩阵的集合才是元层模式。Definition 7.2 使用闭项版，它蕴含数字版，原书指出数字版较弱。\nCT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 证明所有基础矩阵的闭项统一双条件；KF 还对含 T 的正矩阵证明这一形式。FS 的 NEC/CONEC 则是定理规则，不是添加全部自指双条件的公理模式。\n全语言经典双条件遇到 PA 对角句会导致不一致，不能用 FS 的 ω 一致性作逃避条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 7.1–7.2、Lemma 8.4、Lemma 15.4。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CTm}$ 为 [[91-df-coded-syntax]] 的闭项编码域；向量量词逐分量限制在该域。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TBicond},\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{num}},\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{tm}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TBicond}_T(\\varphi)\\coloneqq T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{num}}_T(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec x\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\vec x)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UTBicond}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_T(\\theta)\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))].","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false}],"bytes":2089,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-biconditional]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-m